    "goal": "Co-incubate UGT1A1 with testosterone at 120.7 µM in the presence of a competitive inhibitor to quantify inhibition of glucuronidation.",
    "rationale": "Competitive inhibition of UGT1A1-catalyzed testosterone glucuronidation. Substrate [S]=120.7 µM with Km=84.2 µM; competitive inhibitor Ki=86.6 µM at [I]=53.2 µM; Vmax=0.5246 µmol/min. Fractional activity v_i/v0 = [S]/(Km(1+[I]/Ki)+[S]) = 0.4703, giving 52.97% inhibition, inhibited velocity 0.2467 µmol/min, and apparent Km = Km(1+[I]/Ki) = 135.9 µM. [S] is above Km so substrate partially overcomes the competitive block.",
